WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:02.901
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:02.901 --> 00:00:04.901
You're here. You made it.
Thank you for watching.

00:00:04.901 --> 00:00:07.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.167 --> 00:00:09.334
Well, guys, everyone's
talking about this.

00:00:09.334 --> 00:00:11.234
A federal judge has overruled

00:00:11.234 --> 00:00:14.734
the CDC's mask mandate
for planes,

00:00:14.734 --> 00:00:16.534
and now all the major airlines

00:00:16.534 --> 00:00:19.167
have dropped their
mask requirements.

00:00:19.167 --> 00:00:20.667
But don't worry,
to keep everyone safe,

00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:24.133
you can now bring only up to
3.4 ounces of COVID on board.

00:00:24.133 --> 00:00:25.868
-Oh.
-That's correct.

00:00:25.868 --> 00:00:28.901
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.901 --> 00:00:30.400
To put it another way,

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:32.634
airlines are basically turning
off the seatbelt sign for COVID

00:00:32.634 --> 00:00:34.567
and telling it to move freely
about the cabin.

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:36.200
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.133
Yeah, if you thought
Omicron was bad,

00:00:38.133 --> 00:00:39.968
wait till you meet
the Spirit variant.

00:00:39.968 --> 00:00:43.133
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.133 --> 00:00:44.534
Whoo.
-Whoo!

00:00:44.534 --> 00:00:46.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:49.701 --> 00:00:51.000
-When the news broke,

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.701
some pilots actually
announced the news midflight,

00:00:53.701 --> 00:00:55.400
and people started celebrating.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:56.601
This is true.

00:00:56.601 --> 00:00:58.734
Yeah, passengers were dancing,
hugging, kissing,

00:00:58.734 --> 00:01:00.300
and now they're all
in quarantine.

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:02.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.667
Yeah, there was a crazy scene
on American Airlines.

00:01:04.667 --> 00:01:05.968
People tore off their masks

00:01:05.968 --> 00:01:07.801
and shoved them
right into the ashtrays.

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:08.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:11.200
How old is this plane?
Yeah.

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:12.734
And it's not just planes.

00:01:12.734 --> 00:01:15.601
Amtrak has also ended
their mask mandate.

00:01:15.601 --> 00:01:17.501
Right now train conductors
are celebrating

00:01:17.501 --> 00:01:19.868
by punching 25 tiny holes
in their masks.

00:01:19.868 --> 00:01:23.701
[ Imitates punch clicking ]
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.701 --> 00:01:25.467
"Can I have your mask, please?"
[ Imitates punch clicking ]

00:01:25.467 --> 00:01:27.000
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:28.601
Right now also Uber
has announced

00:01:28.601 --> 00:01:30.701
that they're dropping
all mask requirements.

00:01:30.701 --> 00:01:31.901
Honestly, I'm going to miss

00:01:31.901 --> 00:01:33.634
getting into
a masked stranger's car.

00:01:33.634 --> 00:01:35.400
It was kind of fun
to play that game --

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:37.000
my ride to the airport
or kidnapping?

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.200
You know?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:41.701
Meanwhile, the White House
isn't happy with the ruling.

00:01:41.701 --> 00:01:43.133
They called it disappointing

00:01:43.133 --> 00:01:45.334
and urged travelers
to keep wearing masks,

00:01:45.334 --> 00:01:47.701
but they said that they're
not fighting the decision.

00:01:47.701 --> 00:01:48.868
It's kind of like your parents

00:01:48.868 --> 00:01:50.567
when you tell them
about your new tattoo.

00:01:50.567 --> 00:01:51.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.701 --> 00:01:52.901
"I don't know
if you're going to like

00:01:52.901 --> 00:01:54.234
'Suite Life of Zack and Cody'
in 20 years.

00:01:54.234 --> 00:01:57.300
But go for it.
Get the tattoo.

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:59.234
Hope for a reunion."

00:01:59.234 --> 00:02:01.734
Speaking of the White House,
I read that President Biden

00:02:01.734 --> 00:02:03.434
has told former president Obama

00:02:03.434 --> 00:02:07.501
that he plans to run
for re-election in 2024.

00:02:07.501 --> 00:02:08.767
Biden was like,

00:02:08.767 --> 00:02:11.067
"I'll consider the long,
silent stare your blessing."

00:02:11.067 --> 00:02:13.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:25.434
Yeah, that was a good one.
Yeah, that's a good joke.

00:02:25.434 --> 00:02:27.734
[ Cheers and applause ]
Thank you.

00:02:29.467 --> 00:02:31.100
