some good advice.

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:32.300
He was like, "Be careful.

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:34.267
After two terms,
people might say you look old."

00:02:34.267 --> 00:02:36.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.267 --> 00:02:37.667
