00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:09.100
Switching gears,
this is interesting.

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:11.501
Scientists in Japan
came up with a creative way

00:04:11.501 --> 00:04:13.434
to get people to eat less salt.

00:04:13.434 --> 00:04:14.868
Check this out.

00:04:14.868 --> 00:04:19.000
-Researchers in Japan hope their
new taste-enhancing chopsticks

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:22.434
will make healthy food
low in salt taste better.

00:04:22.434 --> 00:04:24.601
The high-tech utensils
are hooked up

00:04:24.601 --> 00:04:27.667
to a special computer device
on the user's wrist,

00:04:27.667 --> 00:04:30.601
which causes
a small electric current

00:04:30.601 --> 00:04:32.601
to flow through
what they're eating,

00:04:32.601 --> 00:04:34.601
activating any sodium ions

00:04:34.601 --> 00:04:38.234
and allowing for their tongue
to taste more salt

00:04:38.234 --> 00:04:40.100
than is actually in the food.

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:42.801
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:42.801 --> 00:04:44.901
-Wow, it's just that simple!

00:04:44.901 --> 00:04:46.868
[ Laughter ]

00:04:46.868 --> 00:04:49.968
Anyone else see a problem
combining soup and electricity?

00:04:49.968 --> 00:04:51.400
[ Laughter ]

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:53.400
If you want to save time, just
pour the soup over your head

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:55.868
and plug yourself into a wall.

